{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "SERK: Chaos City Delivery ",
    "steam_appid": 3154910,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154910/extras/3d01584d281707af78eb039c62f6448a.avif?t=1753182718\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SERK: Chaos City Delivery</strong><br>I created this game to express the daily struggles of people living in chaotic cities around the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're on your way, then suddenly\u2014bam! A car or tuk-tuk swerves toward you with no signal, no warning.<br>In this city, drivers follow their own rules... or none at all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll need to rely on every camera angle the game provides \u2014 because trust me, you'll need it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t expect an easy ride. This game is meant to be harsh, frustrating, and painfully real.<br>The message is simple: we need proper traffic systems in these cities \u2014 too many people get hurt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No more pain. Just chaos, challenge, and a dash of fun.<br>The game is currently in demo phase \u2014 your feedback is more than welcome!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154910/extras/499b7f754cb811ff753a309fcac4b5d7.poster.avif?t=1753182718\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154910/extras/499b7f754cb811ff753a309fcac4b5d7.webm?t=1753182718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154910/extras/499b7f754cb811ff753a309fcac4b5d7.mp4?t=1753182718\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154910/extras/dfa457857b6f4b51a269506ae1b845b1.avif?t=1753182718\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span> </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154910/extras/3d01584d281707af78eb039c62f6448a.avif?t=1753182718\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SERK: Chaos City Delivery</strong><br>I created this game to express the daily struggles of people living in chaotic cities around the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're on your way, then suddenly\u2014bam! A car or tuk-tuk swerves toward you with no signal, no warning.<br>In this city, drivers follow their own rules... or none at all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll need to rely on every camera angle the game provides \u2014 because trust me, you'll need it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t expect an easy ride. This game is meant to be harsh, frustrating, and painfully real.<br>The message is simple: we need proper traffic systems in these cities \u2014 too many people get hurt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No more pain. Just chaos, challenge, and a dash of fun.<br>The game is currently in demo phase \u2014 your feedback is more than welcome!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154910/extras/499b7f754cb811ff753a309fcac4b5d7.poster.avif?t=1753182718\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154910/extras/499b7f754cb811ff753a309fcac4b5d7.webm?t=1753182718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154910/extras/499b7f754cb811ff753a309fcac4b5d7.mp4?t=1753182718\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154910/extras/dfa457857b6f4b51a269506ae1b845b1.avif?t=1753182718\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span> </p>",
    "short_description": "Are you from a city with no traffic? Do you feel that pain? Yes? I built this game for you \u2014 it simulates how a chaotic city with no traffic rules makes people suffer. No? Then it\u2019s your time to find out what the other side of the world feels like!",
